  "prompt": "For each account segment, how many LedgerLoop subscriptions were running on 31 December 2025, billed monthly and billed annually? A subscription is running on that day when its start_date is on or before it and its end_date is missing or after it. Return three columns, in this order: segment, monthly_subs and annual_subs. A billing period with no running subscription in a segment shows 0. Return one row for each segment with a running subscription. Any row order is fine.",
